config BR2_PACKAGE_GAME_LAUNCHER
	bool "game-launcher"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SDL_FBCON
	help
	  `game NAME` launches one of the bundled SDL 1.2 games on the LCD:
	  it stops FastCarPlay (which owns the display and grabs the
	  keyboards) and starts it again afterwards if it was running,
	  runs the game at 792 MHz, and resets the VT and framebuffer
	  around it (vtreset) so a game that crashed cannot leave VT
	  switching locked for the next one.
